<Slide id="data" background="#FFFFFF">
    <Box id="data/frame" class="frame">
      <Text id="data/kicker" class="kicker">TABLE / LINE CHART / NATIVE OBJECTS</Text>
      <Text id="data/title" class="title">预览保留数值，交付保留对象。</Text>
      <Box id="data/grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:7fr 5fr;gap:32px;height:390px">
        <Chart id="data/line" type="line" markers="true" style="height:360px;font-size:16px;color:#536B78">
          <Labels>Q1|Q2|Q3|Q4</Labels>
          <Series name="示例序列 A" color="#087E6D">-8 12 18 24</Series>
          <Series name="示例序列 B" color="#1D4ED8">2 8 16 20</Series>
        </Chart>
        <Table id="data/table" columns="1 1 1" style="background:#FFFFFF;height:300px;font-size:18px;line-height:28px">
          <Row style="background:#EBF0F8;font-weight:700"><Cell>季度</Cell><Cell>序列 A</Cell><Cell>序列 B</Cell></Row>
          <Row><Cell>Q1</Cell><Cell>-8</Cell><Cell>2</Cell></Row>
          <Row><Cell>Q2</Cell><Cell>12</Cell><Cell>8</Cell></Row>
          <Row><Cell>Q3</Cell><Cell>18</Cell><Cell>16</Cell></Row>
          <Row><Cell>Q4</Cell><Cell>24</Cell><Cell>20</Cell></Row>
        </Table>
      </Box>
      <Text id="data/note" style="height:56px;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;color:#536B78">数值仅用于渲染测试。原生图表固定了绘图区、图例和刻度，文字仍由各应用排版。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Slide>
